OL,3,GNEWSALifeboat crews sent 'threats'
OL,4,Aduring migrant rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has been launched
OL,7,Fafter "disgusting threats" were made to
OL,8,Flifeboat volunteers via radio during an
OL,9,Foperation to bring migrants ashore.
OL,11,FThe Home Office said 149 migrants were
OL,12,Fpicked up on Sunday in a mid-Channel
OL,13,Frescue operation by the RNLI, alongside
OL,14,Fa French vessel, and were taken to
OL,15,FGosport.
OL,17,FHampshire police said it received
OL,18,Freports of four suspicious broadcast
OL,19,Fmessages transmitted over VHF radio in
OL,20,FPortsmouth Harbour between 22:00 BST on
OL,21,FSunday and 18:00 on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
