OL,3,GNEWSALifeboat crews sent 'threats'
OL,4,Aduring migrant rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FGosport and Fareham Inshore Rescue
OL,7,FService, which was involved in the
OL,8,Frescue, described the threats as
OL,9,F"abhorrent" and said its crews should
OL,10,Fbe able to carry out their lifesaving
OL,11,Fwork "without fear of violence".
